Z||000001||avengador1||12-22-2001||06:30 PM||||Your steering rack is going. I have the same problem, except it feels like a "pop" when I turn the wheel all the way. It's time for a rebuild or replacement. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
